WEBVTT

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:02.833
Power Platform connects business apps,

00:00:02.833 --> 00:00:04.767
automation, websites, and agents.

00:00:04.967 --> 00:00:06.833
Dataverse gives them shared tables,

00:00:06.833 --> 00:00:08.500
relationships, and security.

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:11.567
Develop an unmanaged solution in source control,

00:00:11.567 --> 00:00:13.500
then promote the same managed artifact

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:14.900
through test and production.

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:16.533
Configure each environment's

00:00:16.533 --> 00:00:18.267
connections and variables;

00:00:18.267 --> 00:00:20.300
migrate table records separately.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:23.300
Use Power Platform pipelines, GitHub Actions,

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:24.967
or Azure DevOps Build Tools

00:00:24.967 --> 00:00:26.200
to automate delivery.

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:28.400
Before release, check connector policies,

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:30.333
tests, monitoring, licensing,

00:00:30.333 --> 00:00:31.600
and feature availability.

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:33.600
Low code makes delivery faster,

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:34.967
not governance optional.
